<view class="page login"><image src="/assets/wordmark.png" class="brand" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="title">让门店工作<br/>更轻松一点。</view><view class="muted intro">公司与加盟门店的员工工作台</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">员工手机号登录</view><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="已在 ERP 登记的手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="phoneInput"/><view class="code-row"><input class="field code" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="6 位验证码" value="{{code}}" bindinput="codeInput"/><button class="send" disabled="{{sending || seconds>0 || submitting}}" bindtap="send">{{sending?'发送中…':seconds>0?seconds+'s 后重发':'获取验证码'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="message">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="button" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{submitting || sending}}" loading="{{submitting}}">{{submitting?'正在验证员工身份':'登录工作台'}}</button><button wx:if="{{retryRestore}}" class="button-secondary retry" bindtap="restore" disabled="{{submitting}}">重试连接，不重新收验证码</button></view><view class="muted notice">仅已登记员工可访问。微信身份绑定将在专属员工小程序开通后启用，不与消费者账号混用。</view><button wx:if="{{canPreview}}" class="preview-button" bindtap="enterPreview">查看初版界面（示例数据）</button></view>
